Hocuspanda is a Wayland compositor and its whole shell (widget column,
launcher, notifications, quick settings, lock screen) in a single Rust
process, built on smithay. Display managers offer it as the "Hocuspanda"
session; it also starts from a virtual terminal with `hocuspanda`.

The package holds the desktop (hocuspanda), its command-line tool (hocus)
and its settings app (hocus-settings).
